    {
      "source": "Execute the given <code>task</code> synchronously, through direct\ninvocation of its <a href=\"TaskCallback.html#call()\"><code>call()</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "同步执行给定的<code>task</code>，通过直接调用其<a href=\"TaskCallback.html#call()\"><code>call()</code></a>方法。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Execution in the calling thread does have the advantage of participating\nin its thread context, for example the thread context class loader or the\nthread's current transaction association. That said, in many cases,\nasynchronous execution will be preferable: choose an asynchronous\n<code>TaskExecutor</code> instead for such scenarios.",
      "translation": "在调用线程中执行确实具有参与其线程上下文的优点，例如线程上下文类加载器或线程的当前事务关联。不过，在许多情况下，异步执行更可取：对于此类场景，请选择异步<code>TaskExecutor</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the given <code>task</code> synchronously, through direct\ninvocation of its <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Runnable.html#run()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>run()</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "同步执行给定的<code>task</code>，通过直接调用其<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Runnable.html#run()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>run()</code></a>方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">RuntimeException</a></code> - if propagated from the given <code>Runnable</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">RuntimeException</a></code> - 如果从给定的 <code>Runnable</code> 传播",
      "count": 2
    },
